1483
01:43:34,964 --> 01:43:38,380
- I thought you were smarter than that.
- Raymond, please.

1484
01:43:38,593 --> 01:43:40,253
You don't think they saw this
coming, Ben?

1485
01:43:41,220 --> 01:43:43,593
