01:49:24,739 --> 01:49:26,399
Yes, Mother.

1543
01:49:30,703 --> 01:49:32,281
But...

1544
01:49:36,375 --> 01:49:38,534
But when you smile...

1545
01:49:39,504 --> 01:49:44,082
...oh, darling, when you smile,
that's what I live for.

1546
01:49:46,177 --> 01:49:49,048
When you smile.

1547
