- Yeah!

1567
01:52:08,156 --> 01:52:09,484
All right! Yes!

1568
01:52:10,033 --> 01:52:11,942
- Yes.
- Hi.

1569
01:52:22,587 --> 01:52:24,663
Thank you. Thank you.

1570
01:52:25,131 --> 01:52:26,923
Thank you.

1571
01:52:36,101 --> 01:52:39,221
Let's have a good show, people.
